&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Taken by the Sky &ndash; Fleetwood Mac&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Eagle Eyes &ndash; Eagles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Petty Fever &ndash; Tom Petty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
