&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Revival Brothers &ndash; Allman Brothers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;Legends Reloaded is an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;all-ages music event&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt; with optional overnight RV/Tent camping available for ages 21 &amp;amp; over. Overnight access is strictly limited to guests 21+.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir="ltr"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11pt"&gt;&ldquo;We are excited to bring this multi-day festival to Central Oregon,&rdquo; said Bart Platt, Event Complex Manager. &ldquo;This family-friendly festival is exactly the kind of entertainment we strive to deliver to Jefferson County. Music can bring people together like no other form of entertainment&mdash;it proves we are more similar than we are different. We invite everyone to come celebrate our similarities June 19&ndash;20 at the first-ever Legends Reloaded Music Festival.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

