&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Additional&amp;nbsp;information, including the environmental impact statement&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;frequently&amp;nbsp;asked questions, is available at&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW208254788 BCX0" href="https://eplanning.blm.gov/eplanning-ui/project/2030186/510?_gl=1*wej1u3*_ga*MTY0MzcxMDYwNS4xNzYzNjU5ODEw*_ga_GQKKTMMT8V*czE3NjUzMTI5ODckbzE4JGcxJHQxNzY1MzEzMjI0JGo2MCRsMCRoMA.." rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;BLM National NEPA Register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;For more information, please contact&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW208254788 BCX0" href="mailto:blm_or_vl_grassymtn@blm.gov" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;blm_or_vl_grassymtn@blm.gov&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
