     &lt;li&gt;February 24, 2:30 p.m. &ndash; 3:30 p.m. for Preserving Oregon Grants historic archaeology projects. &lt;a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/DPg-uC2xS1OTlR4tY0ptkA"&gt;Register&lt;/a&gt; for access.&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;February 25, 11:00 a.m. &ndash; 12:00 p.m. for Diamonds in the Rough building fa&ccedil;ade projects. &lt;a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/jg42new-QQCFIT7vtnVmPw"&gt;Register&lt;/a&gt; for access.&lt;br /&gt;
     &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
