&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support Christopher&rsquo;s securing an original audio composition by Don Flores and compensating a group of Street Style Dancers from all over the Pacific Northwest to share a unique style of Waving &amp;amp; Popping, in collaboration with Congruency Dance Collective.&lt;/p&gt;

