&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ford Family Foundation, $4,893&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left: 40px;"&gt;To support the first exhibition of Fischer&rsquo;s work at NOON Projects in Los Angeles, California, from April to late May, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;

