&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://apps.oregon.gov/oregon-newsroom/OR/DOR/Posts/Post/UPDATE-Direct-File-Oregon-updated-to-calculate-Oregon-Kids-Credit-correctly"&gt;January 31-Direct File Oregon updated to calculate Oregon Kids Credit correctly&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://apps.oregon.gov/oregon-newsroom/OR/DOR/Posts/Post/Oregon-IRS-begin-processing-e-filed-returns-First-state-refunds-expected-February-17"&gt;January 26-Oregon, IRS begin processing e-filed returns; First state refunds expected February 17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

