&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Chartered by Congress to&amp;nbsp;provide&amp;nbsp;expert advice, the Academy is an independent, nonpartisan, and nonprofit organization&amp;nbsp;established&amp;nbsp;in 1967 to&amp;nbsp;assist&amp;nbsp;government leaders in building more effective, efficient, accountable, and transparent organizations. Learn more at www.napawash.org.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
